@seq 1
@entry PRECEDENT
∀ agent: depth(agent) ≤ 2
∀ gate: retry(gate, ADV ∨ DENY) ≤ 3

⊥ retry_exhausted(gate)
→ 🧾 Trouble(gate, latest_advisory_or_denial)
→ 🧑 Human
→ End(Conversation) ⊣ ⊤

🔎 PRECEDENT
Obj(Task{task_id,target,acceptance}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
⊢ executable($env:LLM_MEMORY_BIN) ∧ outside_sandbox
HIT   ⇒ Evidence(memory=Precedents) → ROUTE
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(memory=N_A(no_precedent)) → ROUTE
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause)) → ROUTE

🔀 ROUTE
RO_LOCAL ∧ valid_local_review ⇒ LOCAL_REVIEW
otherwise ⇒ FULL_ETL → EXPLORE

🔎 LOCAL_REVIEW
Obj(LocalReview{query,targets,scope}) → Mor(local-review.collector) → ReviewReport
⊢ fixed_string(query) ∧ finite_exact_targets(targets) ∧ target_scope(scope)
⊢ collector_commands={rg.fixed_string,git.status.targets,git.diff_check.targets}
⊢ no_edit ∧ no_memory ∧ no_diary ∧ no_external ∧ no_vcs
LOCAL_REVIEW ⇒ ReviewReport → 🧑 Human → End(Conversation) ⊣ ⊤
scope_expansion ∨ edit ∨ public ∨ external ∨ live ∨ vcs ∨ credential ⇒ FULL_ETL → EXPLORE
unknown ∨ conflict ∨ malformed ∨ retry_exhausted ⇒ STOP → 🧑 Human → End(Conversation)

🔭 EXPLORE @codex.selected
Evidence(memory) → Evidence(task)
🧠 PLAN @terra.high
Evidence → Plan
🧐 PRE_VERIFY
Γ ⊢ Plan : Verdict
PASS ⇒ CODE
ADV  ⇒ PLAN ↺
DENY ⇒ PLAN ↺
⚒ CODE @codex.worker
Plan → Change
⊢ explicit_current_task_request(agy) ∧ live_model_resolved ⇒ CODE @agy
¬explicit_current_task_request(agy) ⇒ CODE @codex.worker
🧬 worker* : depth ≤ 2
execution := worker₁ ∥ ... ∥ workerₙ
🧐 POST_VERIFY
Γ ⊢ Change : Verdict
PASS ⇒ FINISH
ADV  ⇒ CODE ↺
DENY ⇒ CODE ↺
🏁 FINISH
Obj(Change ∘ Diff ∘ Checks ∘ Unknowns) → ArtifactSet
ArtifactSet → 🧾 TaskReport ∘ EvaluationJSON
⊢ valid(TaskReport) ∧ valid(EvaluationJSON)
→ 🔎 git.review

⊢ approval(VCS_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ 📦 git.commit → VCSReceipt
¬approval(VCS_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ VCSReceipt=N_A(pending_approval)
ERROR(git.commit) ⇒ VCSReceipt=FAILED(non_secret_cause)

⊢ approval(LIVE_WRITE,current_task) ∧ executable($env:LLM_MEMORY_BIN)
⇒ outside_sandbox(llm-mem.ingest(TaskReport)) → IngestReceipt=SUCCESS(receipt_id)
⇒ outside_sandbox(llm-mem.eval(EvaluationJSON)) → EvaluationReceipt=SUCCESS(receipt_id)
¬approval(LIVE_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ IngestReceipt=N_A(pending_approval) ∧ EvaluationReceipt=N_A(pending_approval)
missing_executable ⇒ IngestReceipt=FAILED(missing_executable) ∧ EvaluationReceipt=FAILED(missing_executable)
ERROR(llm-mem.ingest) ⇒ IngestReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
ERROR(llm-mem.eval) ⇒ EvaluationReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
MemoryReceipt := IngestReceipt ∘ EvaluationReceipt

⊢ approval(EXT_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ external_diary_mirror(memo/<task_id>/diary.md) → ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt
¬approval(EXT_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt=N_A(not_requested)
ERROR(external_diary_mirror) ⇒ ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt=FAILED(process_error)

⊢ final(IngestReceipt) ∧ final(EvaluationReceipt) ∧ final(ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt)
⇒ 🧾 write-task-record(memo/<task_id>/{knowledge.md,diary.md,walkthrough.md,evaluation.json}, IngestReceipt, EvaluationReceipt, ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt)
→ TaskRecordReceipt

🧾 RESULT.share(TaskReport ∘ VCSReceipt ∘ MemoryReceipt) → 🧑 Human
⊢ IngestReceipt=SUCCESS ∧ EvaluationReceipt=SUCCESS ⇒ memory_report_complete
IngestReceipt∈{N_A,FAILED} ∨ EvaluationReceipt∈{N_A,FAILED} ⇒ ¬memory_report_complete
→ End(Conversation) ⊣ ⊤
